&lt;h2&gt;Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build the simulation and model-learning engine at the centre of Constructor&#39;s quantum software. The work is numerics-heavy: differentiable simulation of physical systems, inference of model parameters from experimental data, and optimisation at scale. The role sits between physics and engineering and requires genuine depth in both.&lt;/p&gt;
